Fonts
-----
The evedoo-gui binary embeds the default fonts of the egui project
(crate epaint_default_fonts), which that crate declares as licensed under
the SIL Open Font License 1.1 and the Ubuntu Font Licence 1.0. These
licences apply to the font files only; their texts ship with that crate.

