----------------
Evedoo links third-party Rust crates under permissive licences (MIT,
Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, Zlib, BSL-1.0, Unicode-3.0, CC0-1.0). The exact set
for a given build is recorded in Cargo.lock; the accepted licences are
listed in deny.toml.
